        <description><![CDATA[<div><ul><li>Performance has been improved.</li>
<li>PDFs now convert every page, not just the first one.</li>
<li>SVG compression is now available.</li>
<li>I fixed a crash that happened when you dragged and dropped something.</li>
<li>Compression presets: You can choose from six different compression settings (maximum quality, high quality, balanced, web optimised, social media, maximum compression) or make your own custom settings.</li></ul></div>]]></description>
